Subject: core/io/windows_lock.rs allows dead code
Why: Its shared-WAL locks are unused in kiln's build, so a Windows build warned 17 times.

diff --git a/core/io/windows_lock.rs b/core/io/windows_lock.rs
index 063df5a15e8e6158b974be7cca39ff448d249af1..c21704c1f4b20cbe3e3af3e3efa4ef82b4dc4d02 100644
--- a/core/io/windows_lock.rs
+++ b/core/io/windows_lock.rs
@@ -1,3 +1,6 @@
+// kiln: its shared-WAL locks are unused in kiln's build, which would warn on Windows.
